---
import Layout from '@layouts/Page.astro';
import LinkList from '@components/LinkList.astro';
import { photographyAwards } from '@links/registry';
---

<Layout title="Travel Photographer of the Year (2025)">
  <LinkList slot="sidebar" items={photographyAwards} orientation="vertical" />

  <p class="intro">
I applied to the Travel Photographer of the Year for the Under 14 competition. I had to submit collections of
four coherent images for the competition. I was thrilled when two of my
4-image collections were short-listed. My Places collection came in second place and will be displayed at 3 international exhibits in 2026.
  </p>

  <p>
    My Sphynx photo was featured as #4 in <a href="https://121clicks.com/inspirations/2025-travel-photographer-of-the-year-awards/">121clicks' roundup of the 2025 Travel Photographer of the Year awards</a>.
    It was also featured as #3 in <a href="https://www.protagon.gr/galleries/oi-kalyteres-taksidiwtikes-fwtografies-tou-2025-44343300634#id_5">Protagon's gallery of the best travel photos of 2025</a> (Greek), ranking among all entries including adults.
  </p>

  <figure class="photo">
    <img
      src="/images/photography_awards/tpoty2025_badge.jpg"
      alt="Second Place Badge - Travel Photographer of the Year 2025"
      width="1600"
      height="1067"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <figcaption>Second Place Badge for the Under 14 Travel Photographer of the Year 2025</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <figure class="photo">
    <img
      src="/images/photography_awards/tpoty-2025-logo.png"
      alt="Travel Photographer of the Year finalist"
      width="1600"
      height="1067"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <figcaption>The official logo for short lists</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <figure class="photo">
    <img
      src="/images/photography_awards/tpoty-2025-shortlist.png"
      alt="The 8-person Shortlist for the Under 14 Travel Photographer of the Year award"
      width="1600"
      height="1067"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <figcaption>Here are the Shortlist candidates.</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <figure class="photo">
    <img
      src="/images/photography_awards/tpoty2025-people-collection.png"
      alt="Collection of 4 images of people."
      width="1600"
      height="1067"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <figcaption>Collection of 4 images from Egypt of people that I saw.</figcaption>
  </figure>
 
  <figure class="photo">
    <img
      src="/images/photography_awards/tpoty2025-places-collection.png"
      alt="Collection of 4 images of places."
      width="1600"
      height="1067"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <figcaption>Collection of 4 images from Egypt of buildings and places that I saw. Second place winner, to be displayed at 3 international exhibits in 2026.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</Layout>
